(7730333, 1273204, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is quite beautiful .. you may get marked down as the landscape/seascape is not the main point of interest .. but i dont care .. it works for me .. :)<br/>i love how this image makes me feel she''s about to give the sea a gift of flowers .. and how somehow it makes me feel she is very connected to the sea as well .. and that she is very present and in the moment .. <br/>just my perspective of course .. thankyou .. :)</td>', 'this is quite beautiful .. you may get marked down as the landscape/seascape is not the main point of interest .. but i dont care .. it works for me .. :)i love how this image makes me feel she''s about to give the sea a gift of flowers .. and how somehow it makes me feel she is very connected to the sea as well .. and that she is very present and in the moment .. just my perspective of course .. thankyou .. :)', '2022-09-27 03:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7730334, 1272971, 67145, '<td valign="top">quite dreary and dark .. but has such a great energy with those waves crashing into the image .. they are like a creature .. released from the sea .. <br/>great shot .. hope you got away unscathed .. <br/>i know many photographers will put themselves in quite dangerous situations to get THAT shot .. <br/>some will actually risk their lives .. i think the excitement of being in the moment and capturing the shot they want .. they almost forget where they are in time and space .. the time and space that could kill them .. so focused they are on whats in their viewfinder .. <br/>anyway .. great shot .. and the centered composition totally works for me .. :)</td>', 'quite dreary and dark .. but has such a great energy with those waves crashing into the image .. they are like a creature .. released from the sea .. great shot .. hope you got away unscathed .. i know many photographers will put themselves in quite dangerous situations to get THAT shot .. some will actually risk their lives .. i think the excitement of being in the moment and capturing the shot they want .. they almost forget where they are in time and space .. the time and space that could kill them .. so focused they are on whats in their viewfinder .. anyway .. great shot .. and the centered composition totally works for me .. :)', '2022-09-27 03:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
